IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-FIM-BIDIR.

DATA DIVISION.
01 PREFIX-LEN          PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 SUFFIX-LEN          PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 TARGET-LEN          PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-FIM.
    IF PREFIX-LEN == 0 OR SUFFIX-LEN == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 642800 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 PREFIX-LEN.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
